{"product_id":"if-i-fix-you","title":"If I Fix You","description":"\u003cp\u003e“If I Fix You is a heartrending story about life not being what you hoped for...and being okay anyway.”—#1 New York Times bestselling author Aprilynne PikeSome things are easy to fix…but are some meant to stay broken?When sixteen-year-old Jill Whitaker’s mom walks out—with a sticky note as a goodbye—only Jill knows the real reason she’s gone. But how can she tell her father? Jill can hardly believe the truth herself. Suddenly, the girl who likes to fix things—cars, relationships, romances, people—is all broken up. It used to be that her best friend\/secret crush, Sean Addison, could make her smile in seconds. But not anymore. They don’t even talk.With nothing making sense, Jill tries to pick up the pieces of her life. When a new guy moves in next door—intense, seriously cute, but with scars that he thinks don’t show—Jill finds herself trying to make things better for Daniel. But over one long, hot Arizona summer, she realizes she can’t fix anyone’s life until she fixes her own. And she knows just where to start…Also by Abigail Johnson:Every Other WeekendEven If I FallThe First to Know\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 149 x 216\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Abigail Johnson\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9780373212408\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Hardcover\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 336\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45905787814041,"sku":"11RA9780373212408","price":20.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/691ac4921a546_If_I_Fix_You.jpg?v=1763395474","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/if-i-fix-you","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - BookHero","version":"1.0","type":"link"}